0">And </span><span begin="00:37.410" end="00:37.560">with </span><span begin="00:37.560" end="00:38.130">flesh </span><span begin="00:38.130" end="00:38.400">and </span><span begin="00:38.400" end="00:38.970">blood </span><span begin="00:38.970" end="00:39.090">I </span><span begin="00:39.090" end="00:40.050">commanded </span><span begin="00:40.050" end="00:40.260">an </span><span begin="00:40.260" end="00:41.580">army</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.850" end="00:48.240"><span begin="00:41.850" end="00:42.450">Through </span><span begin="00:42.450" end="00:42.840">it </span><span begin="00:42.840" end="00:43.950">all </span><span begin="00:43.950" end="00:44.340">I </span><span begin="00:44.340" end="00:44.460">have </span><span begin="00:44.460" end="00:45.120">given </span><span begin="00:45.120" end="00:45.300">my </span><span begin="00:45.300" end="00:45.720">home </span><span begin="00:45.720" end="00:46.050">for </span><span begin="00:46.050" end="00:46.140">a </span><span begin="00:46.140" end="00:46.920">moment </span><span begin="00:46.920" end="00:46.980">of </span><span begin="00:46.980" end="00:48.240">glory</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.240" end="00:50.460"><span begin="00:48.240" end="00:49.020">（</span><span begin="00:49.020" end="00:49.110">I </span><span begin="00:49.110" end="00:49.230">gave </span><span begin="00:49.230" end="00:49.290">it </span><span begin="00:49.290" end="00:49.860">all</span><span begin="00:49.860" end="00:50.460">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.460" end="00:52.650"><span begin="00:50.460" end="00:51.120">In </span><span begin="00:51.120" end="00:51.630">the </span><span begin="00:51.630" end="00:52.650">end</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.650" end="00:57.480"><span begin="00:52.650" end="00:52.860">As </span><span begin="00:52.860" end="00:53.010">you </span><span begin="00:53.010" end="00:53.520">fade </span><span begin="00:53.520" end="00:54.480">into </span><span begin="00:54.480" e